The GetPendingTransactions function is responsible for fetching all unconfirmed transactions in the current transaction pool and returning them as RPC-formatted transaction objects to the client.

Similar to the other functions, it receives the faulty slice returned by PendingTransactions, then iterates over it. Since the slice indices from 0 to len(res.Txs)-1 are filled with zero values, this leads to several detrimental effects.

